WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.437
[MUSIC]

00:00:06.437 --> 00:00:08.500
You've come to a special place.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.050
You're here at a special time.

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:13.543
You have a great opportunity
in front of you.

00:00:13.543 --> 00:00:16.189
We are so excited to have you here.

00:00:16.189 --> 00:00:18.054
[MUSIC]

00:00:18.054 --> 00:00:19.447
Welcome to Stanford.

00:00:19.447 --> 00:00:21.053
&gt;&gt; [APPLAUSE]
&gt;&gt; Is this is your first time

00:00:21.053 --> 00:00:21.610
seeing the room?

00:00:21.610 --> 00:00:23.027
&gt;&gt; Yeah.
[LAUGH] Here,

00:00:23.027 --> 00:00:25.800
you'll see the nice natural light.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:28.395
There's actually a nice kitchen.

00:00:28.395 --> 00:00:30.000
Erin, hi.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.726
&gt;&gt; My God, hello.

00:00:31.726 --> 00:00:34.291
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH]
&gt;&gt; Don't look at my room.

00:00:34.291 --> 00:00:37.826
[MUSIC]

00:00:37.826 --> 00:00:40.492
&gt;&gt; My name is Juanita Duque,
I'm from Colombia.

00:00:40.492 --> 00:00:44.540
I cannot say, I'm so excited to meet
everybody, all the classes, everything.

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:48.550
&gt;&gt; I really like that GSB has
a strong culture of vulnerability and

00:00:48.550 --> 00:00:51.170
being honest about who you are and
being authentic.

00:00:51.170 --> 00:00:54.340
I think it's really easy in the business
world and the political world to have this

00:00:54.340 --> 00:00:58.351
cookie cutter image of who you are, but at
GSB people just kind of open up about what

00:00:58.351 --> 00:01:01.100
their story is, what they really care
about, and that's something that I'm

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:03.270
trying to push myself to do
over the next couple of years.

00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:04.840
So that's why I wanted to come.

00:01:04.840 --> 00:01:07.360
&gt;&gt; Overall,
I'm most excited to meet people and

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:10.616
make relationships that I hope
will last my whole lifetime.

00:01:10.616 --> 00:01:13.950
&gt;&gt; The most exciting this for
me is to discover possibilities,

00:01:13.950 --> 00:01:18.380
which means to really understand the full
potential of things that I can do here.

00:01:18.380 --> 00:01:19.560
People that I can meet.

00:01:19.560 --> 00:01:20.850
&gt;&gt; I think the energy.

00:01:20.850 --> 00:01:24.695
It's like the people, the opportunities,
the excitement that everybody has.

00:01:24.695 --> 00:01:26.258
[LAUGH]

00:01:26.258 --> 00:01:36.258
[MUSIC]

